      "content": "but what difference does it actually make? i'm just one person and they've already wiped me out. i can't even look in the mirror without seeing someone who was stupid enough to believe the world was fair. i'm not some hero, i'm just a person who's broken and has nothing left to fight for. even if i keep talking, the world just keeps spinning and the people who did this are still winning. it feels like the only honest conclusion is that trying to be good is just a slow way to suffer.",
